# S-05 — Staff identity and roles (#47–#52, #123–#128, create-admin). Result 30 Sep 2026: all as expected.
# CLI: create-admin → exit 0, one-time password, audit_log actor cli:create-admin.
# login wrong password 401 auth.invalid_credentials · login (email case-insensitive) → mfaToken, totpEnrolled=false ·
# verify before enrol 401 auth.totp_not_enrolled · enrol → otpauth URI · verify → 200 (expiresIn 600) + t3s_srt
# (Path=/v1/admin/auth) · /admin/me 200; MFA token on /admin/me 401; staff token on a customer route 401 ·
# create 201 + oneTimePassword · duplicate 409 staff.email_taken · unknown role 400 · list/update/reset-password/
# reset-totp/unlock OK, audited with masked personal fields · viewer on /admin/staff 403 auth.forbidden ·
# re-enrol after a completed login 403 · wrong TOTP 401 auth.totp_invalid · 5 wrong passwords → 423
# auth.account_locked with lockedUntil · staff-login rate policy 429 after 10 calls / 15 min per IP.
@base = http://localhost:5080

# dotnet Ta3lom.Store.Api.dll create-admin --email admin@smoke.test --name "Smoke Admin"

### #47 Login → { mfaToken, totpEnrolled }
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@smoke.test", "password": "{{oneTimePassword}}" }

### #48 Enrol TOTP (MFA bearer) → { otpauthUri, secretBase32 }
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/auth/totp/enrol
Authorization: Bearer {{mfaToken}}

### #49 Verify TOTP → { accessToken, expiresIn: 600, staff } + t3s_srt
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/auth/totp/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{mfaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "123456" }

### #50 Refresh (t3s_srt cookie)
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/auth/refresh

### #51 Logout → 204
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/auth/logout

### #52 Me
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### #123 List staff (staff:admin; a viewer gets 403 auth.forbidden)
GET {{base}}/v1/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### #124 Create staff → 201 { staff, oneTimePassword }; again → 409 staff.email_taken
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "viewer@smoke.test", "name": "Viewer", "roles": ["viewer"] }

### #125 Update
PUT {{base}}/v1/admin/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Viewer Two", "roles": ["viewer", "fulfilment"], "isActive": true }

### #126 Reset password → { oneTimePassword }
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### #127 Reset TOTP → 204
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/reset-totp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### #128 Unlock → 204
POST {{base}}/v1/admin/staff/{{staffId}}/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
